          "title": "小五机器人",
          "content": "<p>腾讯 Robotics X 实验室，发布“小五”机器人（The Five），用于家居环境，适合养老、医疗等场景。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202410/bg2024100107.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>该机器人有四条腿，轮足复合设计，在平地、斜坡、鹅卵石地面都可以行走，还可以爬梯。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202410/bg2024100108.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>它的两只手可以搀扶老人，也可以搬运物品。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202410/bg2024100110.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202410/bg2024100109.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>\n<p>不需要的时候，它还能折叠起来，便于收纳和运输。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.beekka.com/blogimg/asset/202410/bg2024100111.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" /></p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "小五机器人",
              "url": "https://www.sohu.com/a/811566628_120201799"
            }
          ],
          "images": [
